    <briefdescription>
<para>Encapsulates information needed to describe a parameter. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The description of the parameter is not linked directly to OpenMP or any other vector function description. This structure is extendible to handle other paradigms that describe vector functions and their parameters. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
